        {"t": [3, 5], "es": "el neumático", "base": "tyre", "sense": "wheel", "note": "Palabra británica; en EE. UU., *tire* ([[british-american]])."},
        {"t": [4], "es": "Palmer"},
        {"t": [6, 7], "es": "puede decir", "base": "tell", "sense": "inform"},
        {"t": [8], "es": "nos, a nosotros"},
